    "about": "Suggested Table 5 line for an OpenEMR user, from the NUCC taxonomy code in the user's Taxonomy field. The first rule whose match equals the code, or is a prefix of it, applies. provider false marks personnel who aren't providers on that line (Appendix A), so their encounters are not visits. A code no rule matches gets no suggestion, and the clinic chooses the line in the module's settings, as it can for anyone. OpenEMR gives every new user 207Q00000X (Family Medicine) by default, so that code is only ever a suggestion to confirm.",
